Source: unbound-apt-source
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: unbound-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key of the Unbound APT repository
 The key that signs the Unbound APT repository at
 https://unbound-linux.github.io/apt, and an APT pin that allows the
 repository to provide only Unbound's own packages.

Package: unbound-apt-source
Architecture: all
Depends: unbound-archive-keyring, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: unbound-apt-source-testing
Replaces: unbound-apt-source-testing
Description: Unbound APT repository, release channel
 Makes APT follow the release channel of the Unbound APT repository, which
 carries tagged versions of the Unbound desktop. Install
 unbound-apt-source-testing instead to follow every change merged to main.

Package: unbound-apt-source-testing
Architecture: all
Depends: unbound-archive-keyring, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: unbound-apt-source
Replaces: unbound-apt-source
Description: Unbound APT repository, testing channel
 Makes APT follow the testing channel of the Unbound APT repository, which
 carries a build of every change merged to main. Install unbound-apt-source
 instead to follow tagged releases only.
